  border: 2px solid red;
  border-radius: 5px;
}

sections.content:
The 
border-radius property is used to add rounded borders to an element:

Normal border

Round border

Rounder border

Roundest border

Example

p {
  border: 2px solid red;
  border-radius: 5px;
}

Try it Yourself »

