right: 0px;

  width: 300px;

  border: 3px solid green;
  padding: 10px;

}

Try it Yourself »

Another method for aligning an element to the left or right, is to use the 
float property:

Example

.right
{

  float: right;

width: 300px;

  border: 3px solid green;
  padding: 10px;

}

